Dear friends of Our Lady!

The Legion of Mary is an Association of Catholics, who with the approval of 
the church and under the powerful leadership of Mary Immaculate, mediatrix 
of all graces, have formed themselves into a legion for service of warfare 
against the World and its evil powers. {L H B.chapter 1, p. 9} The mission 
statement for these purpose was, make Our Blessed Mother Mary Known, 
understood, Appreciated and Obeyed Throughout the World. But i want to 
emphasize to you personally, how critical you are to this struggle.

  With all my heart, i believe that Our Mother Mary has hand-picked you {and 
people like you } to be Her instrument in this great Task.In the early 
thirties the Legion of Mary was established in Lagos. Fr J. Kilbey, who was 
a close friend of Brother Frank Duff, was a zealous promoter of this 
association, which recieved every encouragement from the apostolic delegate 
at the time of Cardinal Riberi
.
At St Brigid's Catholic Church, Our Lady of Perpetual Help Curia was 
inaugurated on 27th November, 1999. Begining with 9 praesidia, we are now 23 
praesidia. Because of these low growth of the Legion of Mary in the parish, 
we are facing a very serious situation. In the last 12 month, Our Lady of 
Perpetual Help Curia, just completed the  Blessed Mother Mary Shrine. Even 
while our energies and resources were stretched razor-thin by the fight for 
Our Blessed Mother Mary Shrine, we nevertheless manage to keep regular 
project going forward and even growing. Unfortunately, all these many 
accomplishments and important victories have not come without a significant 
cost. Over the past year, we have put off critically important and 
desperately needed, The 'MARY HOUSE'. And what makes it doubly sad is that 
it comes on the heels of so many successes.

By the intercession of Our Blessed Mother and with the effort of Brother 
Tony Offor, {curia president} who always rendered in love as Christ loved us 
and gave himself for us, finaly made the last Date a reality after unseason 
shifting because of financial burdens.The ceremony was celebrated  Monday 
15th August 2005. [The feast of the Assumption of the Blessed Virgin Mary]

The ceremony was performed by, Anthony Cardina Okogie and our indefatigable 
spiritual director Rev,Fr.Augustine O.Garuba and the goodwill of all the 
members. However there has not been any set back in the Curia, because the 
bane of Our Lady of Perpetual Help Curia is that of mobilization attendance 
at our various gatharings.

Though we have come a long way to make this project a huge success, still 
the same financial burdens wouldn't make things work smoothly.Since August 
to date, the rate of Our Lady's House is still at a low level, this is why 
we want you to be identify with this great project for Our Mother Mary. 
Friends of Our Most Blessed Queen of all Heart, in these dark and dangerious 
days, the work of Our Blessed Mother Mary has never been so important or so 
needed as now. yet we can only do what you and other dear friends of Our 
Lady give us the means to do. we desperately need your prayers and financial 
help at this critical moment. Any size gift is important at this point, but 
please be generious as you can.

  We in the city of Mary Immaculate must not stop working, it is a matter of 
saving souls, undertake and achieve great things for Our noble Queen. As you 
do Our Mother Mary will guide you, protect you and lead you ever closer to 
the sacred Heart of Her Divine Son, our Lord Jesue Christ.
Yours in Jesus, Mary and Joseph.

Paul Edet
[ Curia secretary]

